Usage: cardano-cli conway query gov-action-status
                                                    [--cardano-mode
                                                      [--epoch-slots SLOTS]]
                                                    ( --mainnet
                                                    | --testnet-magic NATURAL
                                                    )
                                                    --socket-path SOCKET_PATH
                                                    [ --volatile-tip
                                                    | --immutable-tip
                                                    ]
                                                    --gov-action-id GOV-ACTION-ID
                                                    [ --output-json
                                                    | --output-yaml
                                                    ]
                                                    [--out-file FILEPATH]

  Query the ratification status of a governance action.

Available options:
  --cardano-mode           For talking to a node running in full Cardano mode
                           (default).
  --epoch-slots SLOTS      The number of slots per epoch for the Byron era.
                           (default: 21600)
  --mainnet                Use the mainnet magic id. This overrides the
                           CARDANO_NODE_NETWORK_ID environment variable
  --testnet-magic NATURAL  Specify a testnet magic id. This overrides the
                           CARDANO_NODE_NETWORK_ID environment variable
  --socket-path SOCKET_PATH
                           Path to the node socket. This overrides the
                           CARDANO_NODE_SOCKET_PATH environment variable. The
                           argument is optional if CARDANO_NODE_SOCKET_PATH is
                           defined and mandatory otherwise.
  --volatile-tip           Use the volatile tip as a target. (This is the
                           default)
  --immutable-tip          Use the immutable tip as a target.
  --gov-action-id GOV-ACTION-ID
                           Governance action ID (bech32 gov_action1... or
                           txid#index).
  --output-json            Format gov-action-status query output to JSON
                           (default).
  --output-yaml            Format gov-action-status query output to YAML.
  --out-file FILEPATH      Optional output file. Default is to write to stdout.
  -h,--help                Show this help text
